<Base title="About"><article class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE JOURNAL</div><h1>The Unfinished Creator</h1><p>This independent publication examines a recurring human question: what happens when intelligence becomes capable of creating intelligence?</p><p>Our method distinguishes primary historical texts, scholarly interpretation, contemporary science, and speculative analogy. Ancient myths are not presented as evidence that their authors predicted artificial intelligence.</p><p>Every published essay aims to make its sources inspectable and its uncertainties explicit.</p></article></Base>
